{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutter Evidence is an exploration-action experience where you pilot a drone through active crime scenes, illuminating secrets by photographing evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Each crime scene carries its own atmosphere, puzzles, and dark secrets it conceals. Some areas are locked; as you find keys, you gain access to new sections and step into areas filled with deeper mysteries.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph The right angle, perfect timing, and striking composition \u2014 these earn you the most valuable evidence.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress From abandoned houses to dark warehouses, from luxury villas to mysterious workplaces \u2014 each location presents a different challenge. As your missions advance, culprits become more vigilant and evidence is hidden deeper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate You can experience this tension-filled exploration alone or dive into a more tactical, deeper experience as a team with your friends in co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide The culprits are still at the scene. The moment they notice you, tension rises and your drone can take major damage; therefore stealth, attention, and quick thinking are keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides a secret. Ready your camera, collect your keys, and start photographing evidence to reveal the truth. Shutter Evidence \u2014 enter silently, record everything, exit without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103020?t=1770526188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4103020?t=1770526188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/5c2332c34ffade52daf8157760bd77e0dc3d29bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770526188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/5c2332c34ffade52daf8157760bd77e0dc3d29bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770526188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"\"Shutter Evidence contains low-poly stylized depictions of crime scenes, including bloodstains and evidence of criminal activity. The game focuses on investigation and evidence collection rather than graphic violence. Players examine crime scenes from a drone's perspective to gather photographic evidence. The visual style is intentionally simplified and not realistic. There is no depiction of active violence, sexual content, drug use, or self-harm. The game does not contain horror elements or disturbing imagery.\""},"demos":[{"appid":4105880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shutter Evidence is an exploration-action experience where you pilot a drone through active crime scenes, illuminating secrets by photographing evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Each crime scene carries its own atmosphere, puzzles, and dark secrets it conceals. Some areas are locked; as you find keys, you gain access to new sections and step into areas filled with deeper mysteries.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/fda9016372f059d9a9025ef206ae55c1.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photograph The right angle, perfect timing, and striking composition \u2014 these earn you the most valuable evidence.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/ba0d00fec369333566bfbe7a19d8ed7a.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress From abandoned houses to dark warehouses, from luxury villas to mysterious workplaces \u2014 each location presents a different challenge. As your missions advance, culprits become more vigilant and evidence is hidden deeper</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/887285342f9a29abca240b77ccc09ad5.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperate You can experience this tension-filled exploration alone or dive into a more tactical, deeper experience as a team with your friends in co-op mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/0c368521ea6ab3741cd000b661e65fb5.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide The culprits are still at the scene. The moment they notice you, tension rises and your drone can take major damage; therefore stealth, attention, and quick thinking are keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.poster.avif?t=1770526188\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.webm?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/extras/72eca4988d251d6c0cfb5f2e442f9d49.mp4?t=1770526188\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides a secret. Ready your camera, collect your keys, and start photographing evidence to reveal the truth. Shutter Evidence \u2014 enter silently, record everything, exit without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Mad Turtle Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103020/6722b869f35bcf22909eb55338d8e3793d0c051a/header.jpg?t=1770526188","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><